    <name>Joseph-Huber-Gedenkbank – Mika Parkplatz Römerweg Runde von Freienried</name>
    <desc>Distance: 7.299km, Estimated duration: 1.93h, Elevation up: 70.85620023335053m, Elevation down: 68.59401965285741m, Grade: easy</desc>
    <author>
      <name>Robert Kampf</name>
